{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1377111-good-feats-and-scenes-for-someone-with-high-awareness","id":1377111,"title":"Good feats and scenes for someone with high awareness?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-03-28T23:45:27-07:00","id":1377111,"title":"Good feats and scenes for someone with high awareness?","content":"So I have a solar character. Awareness favored (medicine supernal). She's got awareness 3, essence 3. She's got sensory acuity prana, surprise anticipation method, keen sight technique, and all those other things. I know that awareness charms like this are things that let you do shit like see through fog and darkness like nobody's business and let your answers act more like high powered cameras or binoculars. But other than actually being able to sense far off stuff and see the individual mites in the eyebrows of the enemy commander, what else can Awareness be used for, in a cool way?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-29T00:27:38-07:00","id":1377117,"title":"","content":"Knowing the exact number of enemies in a room at a glance.<br /> <br /> Finding enemies hiding behind a secret panel by hearing their heartbeats.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-29T00:45:56-07:00","id":1377123,"title":"","content":"Just vision or all senses?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-29T00:58:09-07:00","id":1377126,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1377111-good-feats-and-scenes-for-someone-with-high-awareness?p=1377123#post1377123\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just vision or all senses?</div> </div> </div> </div>All senses.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-29T01:19:31-07:00","id":1377129,"title":"","content":"<b>Re: Awareness Stunts</b><br /> <br /> If you are familiar with the Marvel Comics character <i>Daredevil</i>, then many of that character's super-sensory feats and gimmicks would be a good place to start. Depending on what charms you have you might be able to ..<br /> <br /> Detect the mood and emotional state of a person by the sound of their heartbeat, or even scent.<br /> Read the text on a piece of parchment with your fingertips by feeling the texture of the ink.<br /> Be able to deduce where a person has been that day by the scents clinging to their clothing.<br /> Decipher every ingredient and the exact proportions of each with a few tastes of the meal.<br /> Be able to target opponents at close range in combat that you cannot see with hearing, scent, or even by feeling subtle shifts in the air.<br /> Be able to count the number of marching troops by the sound of their advance.<br /> Tell that a subject has been poisoned or succumb to disease by the change in their scent. At a high enough level, be able to identify the poison or disease by scent.<br /> Identify nuances of color, sound and texture lost on those with less acute senses.<br /> Count the number of fish in a pond by tasting the water.<br /> Deduce an individuals age, sex, and general health by taste or scent.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1420009-the-artificer-s-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">The Artificer's Workshop</a> - A collection of Exalted Artifacts<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806809-curios-relics-and-tomes\" target=\"_blank\">Curios, Relics, and Tomes</a> - A collection of Relics (Cursed and Otherwise)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/793173-the-horror-show\" target=\"_blank\">The Horror Lab</a> - A collection of Beasts, Monsters and less definable things.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1128197-strange-places#post1128197\" target=\"_blank\">Strange Places</a> - A collection of Dark, Mysterious, and Wondrous Locations<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/993181-twilight-menagerie\" target=\"_blank\">Twilight Menagerie</a> - A collection of Ephemeral Entities","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/775-reighnhell","name":"Reighnhell","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar775_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"749"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-29T01:23:18-07:00","id":1377130,"title":"","content":"Seeing at a glance that somebody near death is still alive by seeing the nearly imperceptible throb of their pulse.<br /> <br /> Seeing almost perfectly in nearly pitch blackness.<br /> <br /> Navigating in literal pitch blackness by feeling the air currents or echo-locating yourself with your own voice.<br /> <br /> know a battle happened several miles away by tasting blood on the wind.<br /> <br /> Read paper with your fingertips by feeling the ink<br /> <br /> Taste in an oyster that somebody spilled a barrel of spice in the harbour<br /> <br /> Feel the rumble of an army a day's march away by touching the road they walk on<br /> <br /> listen to the whispered conversation of some campers from across a lake<br /> <br /> detecting by scent that somebody had a conversation with another particular person hours ago.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-29T01:26:58-07:00","id":1377131,"title":"","content":"I often think of this scene from The Bourne Identity when thinking about Awareness as an Ability.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IjrWOZby8s8\" data-code=\"IjrWOZby8s8\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/IjrWOZby8s8/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> Not necessarily the specifics so much as the premise and function of being a trained observer.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-29T03:40:07-07:00","id":1377145,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1377111-good-feats-and-scenes-for-someone-with-high-awareness?p=1377131#post1377131\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" c